# Screencast MCP

A stdio MCP server (TypeScript) for Windows screen recording, frame sampling, and ffmpeg edits.
Read AGENTS.md first: it is the single source for layout, conventions, and the release process.

## Conventions

- Use conventional commits (feat:, fix:, chore:, docs:)
- One tool per file in src/tools/ exporting register(server), wired in src/server.ts; pure helpers in src/utils/
- Keep mcp-tools.json, the README tools table, and docs/index.html in sync with the registered tools
- Add a CHANGELOG.md entry under "## Unreleased"; version bumps happen once per release batch, never for docs/CI/chore-only work (see CONTRIBUTING.md#releases)
